<title>USA: Gottschalks January same-store sales up.</title>
<headline>Gottschalks January same-store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>FRESNO, Calif. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gottschalks Inc said its January same-store sales rose 4.1 percent and total sales rose 7.2 percent to $21.3 million.</p>
<p>On a year-to-date period, same-store sales rose 2.4 percent and total sales rose 6.4 percent to $422.2 million.</p>
<p>The company said last January consisted of five weeks, compared with four this year.</p>
</text>
